00:00:30.380 --> 00:00:36.850
Meanwhile, a Business Insider is reporting
that Eastman is refusing to hand over 37000

00:00:36.850 --> 00:00:40.739
pages of emails to the Capitol Riot Committee.

00:00:40.739 --> 00:00:42.399
So let's go through what's going on.

00:00:42.399 --> 00:00:47.190
John Eastman, a far right lawyer for then-President
Donald Trump who wanted to block his electoral

00:00:47.190 --> 00:00:52.610
