00:00:53.620 --> 00:00:57.920
Eastman previously was ordered by the court
to turn over 101 documents after claiming

00:00:57.920 --> 00:01:03.719
some were confidential legal communications
since he's continued to work through 100000

00:01:03.719 --> 00:01:09.479
pages of emails from his Chapman University
account that the House Committee wants.

00:01:09.479 --> 00:01:13.230
At this time, Eastman is arguing that the
thousands of documents comprising about thirty

00:01:13.230 --> 00:01:17.180
seven thirty six thousand pages should stay
confidential.

00:01:17.180 --> 00:01:22.440
Federal Judge David Carter may continue to
weigh whether he can keep those pages secret.

00:01:22.440 --> 00:01:28.400
Meanwhile, John Eastman is refusing to hand
over 37000 pages of emails to the committee.

00:01:28.400 --> 00:01:30.759
He says they're shielded by attorney client
privilege.

00:01:30.759 --> 00:01:32.490
A judge is weighing the argument.

00:01:32.490 --> 00:01:38.890
Eastman is known for writing a memo detailing
how Trump could overturn the 2020 election.

00:01:38.890 --> 00:01:45.000
I think at this point, we should never again
be subjected to a single word about Hillary's

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:46.020
emails.

00:01:46.020 --> 00:01:52.350
We should never again be held and brutally
pummeled with the idea that Democrats don't

00:01:52.350 --> 00:01:53.979
