00:01:53.979 --> 00:01:56.680
They don't handle information correctly or
any of it.

00:01:56.680 --> 00:01:59.399
Now I will be subjected to that.

00:01:59.399 --> 00:02:00.680
You will be subjected to that.

00:02:00.680 --> 00:02:04.479
We all are going to be subjected to that,
but we really shouldn't have to end.

00:02:04.479 --> 00:02:08.230
The strategy at this point is abundantly clear.

00:02:08.230 --> 00:02:13.460
They are trying to run the clock out on the
January 6th investigation and they indeed

00:02:13.460 --> 00:02:14.540
